a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"衞","place_name_jianti_auto":"衞","start_index":22,"tongjian_id":"8c295ccf-db0e-11ef-b30e-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"有殷","place_name_jianti_auto":"有殷","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c295cd0-db0e-11ef-a040-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":70,"tongjian_id":"8c295cd1-db0e-11ef-ac83-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"龐","place_name_jianti_auto":"庞","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8c295cd2-db0e-11ef-aee2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":130,"tongjian_id":"8c295cd3-db0e-11ef-8316-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"姓譜：周文王子康叔封於衞，至武公子惠孫曾耳爲衞上卿，因氏焉，後有孫武、孫臏，俱善兵。趙明誠金石錄有漢安平相孫根碑云：先出自有殷之裔子，武王定周，封比干墓，胤裔分析，定曰孫焉。姓譜又曰：龐姓，畢公高之後，支庶封於龐，因氏焉。臏，頻忍翻，刖刑也，去膝蓋骨。鄭玄曰：周改臏作刖，刖，斷足也。書傳云：決關梁、踰城郭而略盜者，其刑臏。孫臏蓋以刖足故呼爲臏。說文：臏，膝耑也；類篇：毗賓切。龐，薄江翻。涓，古玄翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"姓谱：周文王子康叔封于衞，至武公子惠孙曾耳为衞上卿，因氏焉，后有孙武、孙膑，俱善兵。赵明诚金石录有汉安平相孙根碑云：先出自有殷之裔子，武王定周，封比干墓，胤裔分析，定曰孙焉。姓谱又曰：庞姓，毕公高之后，支庶封于庞，因氏焉。膑，频忍翻，刖刑也，去膝盖骨。郑玄曰：周改膑作刖，刖，断足也。书传云：决关梁、逾城郭而略盗者，其刑膑。孙膑盖以刖足故呼为膑。说文：膑，膝耑也；类篇：毗宾切。庞，薄江翻。涓，古玄翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8c295cbf-db0e-11ef-9ca2-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":6,"tongjian_id":"8c295cdc-db0e-11ef-9e94-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將軍之官，自周以來有之。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将军之官，自周以来有之。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":20,"tongjian_id":"8c295cdb-db0e-11ef-a28e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"之，往也。","note_content_jianti_auto":"之，往也。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":80,"tongjian_id":"8c295ce0-db0e-11ef-91ab-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":52,"tongjian_id":"8c295ce2-db0e-11ef-9554-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"周","place_name_jianti_auto":"周","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c295ce3-db0e-11ef-9866-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"楚","place_name_jianti_auto":"楚","start_index":69,"tongjian_id":"8c295ce4-db0e-11ef-8c3d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"將，卽亮翻。字林曰：輧車，有衣蔽、無後轅者謂之輜。釋名曰：有邸曰輜，無邸曰輧。傅子曰：周曰輜車，卽輦也。康曰：輧車也，軍行所以載輜重。輜，楚持翻。輧，蒲眠翻。重，直用翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"将，即亮翻。字林曰：輧车，有衣蔽、无后辕者谓之辎。释名曰：有邸曰辎，无邸曰輧。傅子曰：周曰辎车，即辇也。康曰：輧车也，军行所以载辎重。辎，楚持翻。輧，蒲眠翻。重，直用翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":149,"tongjian_id":"8c295ce1-db0e-11ef-9589-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[{"confidence":0.95,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將軍","official_note":"將軍是古代軍事指揮官，在魏國擔任此職，負責統領軍隊作戰。此處描述龐涓在魏國任職，為後文陷害孫臏鋪墊。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"龐涓仕魏爲將軍","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"7d90bb4e-31d0-4a60-9057-c3eaec2c9f96"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將","official_note":"將是軍事指揮官，齊威王計劃任命孫臏為將領以救援趙國，但孫臏因受刑推辭。此處顯示孫臏的軍事才能被認可。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"以孫臏爲將","start_index":108,"tongjian_id":"6d530808-aafc-44df-bbfc-493bac3abdf0"},{"confidence":0.9,"official_category":"軍事指揮","official_name":"將","official_note":"將是軍事指揮官，齊威王改任命田忌為將領，負責實際指揮軍隊救援趙國。此處體現齊國軍事部署的調整。","official_rank":"未知","source_snippet":"乃以田忌爲將","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"3735b768-f61d-402e-b8d0-393edbb89320"}],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_birth_year":-382,"link_death_year":-316,"link_td_description":"孙膑，战国中期军事家，兵家代表人物。","link_td_id":"Q10000349","link_td_number_id":1137,"people_name":"孫臏","people_na