"tongjian_id":"8c295cf1-db0e-11ef-a75f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"齊","place_name_jianti_auto":"齐","resolved_place_entity_id":25,"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8c295cf2-db0e-11ef-9a75-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"趙","place_name_jianti_auto":"赵","place_note":"府邯郸，河北邯郸","resolved_place_entity_id":88,"start_index":110,"tongjian_id":"8c295cfa-db0e-11ef-9ad6-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"桂陵之战","tongjian_id":"war_N0509"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"其后秦穰侯葬此，世谓之安平陵，亦曰安陵镇。明初移曹州治焉...","context_before":"桂陵城[在县西北五十里。本齐邑。","source_end_index":42,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"6f1e2a14-365f-5a18-acd1-e26aae67c5d8","source_start_index":16,"source_text":"《史记》齐威王二十六年，以田忌为将，大破梁军于桂陵。"}],"path":"山东方舆纪要/三、济宁州（卷三十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["人事","军事"],"content":"初，孫臏與龐涓俱學兵法，龐涓仕魏爲將軍，自以能不及孫臏，乃召之；至，則以法斷其兩足而黥之，欲使終身廢棄。齊使者至魏，孫臏以刑徒陰見，說齊使者，齊使者竊載與之齊。田忌善而客待之，進於威王。威王問兵法，遂以爲師。於是威王謀救趙，以孫臏爲將；辭以刑餘之人不可，乃以田忌爲將而孫子爲師，居輜車中，坐爲計謀。","content_fanyi":"当初，孙膑和庞涓一起学习兵法。庞涓在魏国担任将军，自认为才能赶不上孙膑，便召请孙膑前来魏国；孙膑到达后，庞涓却借法令砍断他双脚并施以黥刑，想让他终身被废弃不用。齐国使者来到魏国时，孙膑以受刑囚徒的身份暗中求见，游说齐国使者；齐国使者偷偷用车载着他一起回到齐国。田忌很赏识他，以宾客之礼相待，并将他推荐给齐威王。威王向他询问兵法，随即尊他为军师。这时齐威王谋划援救赵国，想任命孙膑为将军；孙膑以自己是受过刑的人不宜担任为由推辞，于是威王任命田忌为将军，以孙膑为军师，让他坐在有帷帐的辎车中，坐着筹划军事。","content_jianti_auto":"初，孙膑与庞涓俱学兵法，庞涓仕魏为将军，自以能不及孙膑，乃召之；至，则以法断其两足而黥之，欲使终身废弃。齐使者至魏，孙膑以刑徒阴见，说齐使者，齐使者窃载与之齐。田忌善而客待之，进于威王。威王问兵法，遂以为师。于是威王谋救赵，以孙膑为将；辞以刑余之人不可，乃以田忌为将而孙子为师，居辎车中，坐为计谋。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":141,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":1,"tongjian_id":"8c295cbe-db0e-11ef-9d0a-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c295cfd-db0e-11ef-81ae-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"8c295cfe-db0e-11ef-ab03-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：謂事之雜亂紛糾也。解雜亂紛糾者，當善以手解之，不可控拳而擊之。余謂雜亂紛糾者，謂人鬬者耳，非事也。康曰：拳，與絭同。絭者，攘臂繩也。余謂當從索隱說，康說非。夫，音扶。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：谓事之杂乱纷纠也。解杂乱纷纠者，当善以手解之，不可控拳而击之。余谓杂乱纷纠者，谓人鬬者耳，非事也。康曰：拳，与絭同。絭者，攘臂绳也。余谓当从索隐说，康说非。夫，音扶。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":24,"tongjian_id":"8c295cfc-db0e-11ef-b287-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"師古","people_name_jianti_auto":"师古","start_index":84,"tongjian_id":"8c295d02-db0e-11ef-aca9-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"毛晃","people_name_jianti_auto":"毛晃","start_index":96,"tongjian_id":"8c295d03-db0e-11ef-953e-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：搏撠，音博戟，謂救鬬者當善撝解之，毋以手相搏撠，則其怒益熾矣。按撠，謂以手持撠以刺人也。余謂索隱之說善矣，但以撠爲持撠以刺人則非也。撠，如漢書「撠太后掖」之撠，師古曰：撠，謂拘持之也。毛晃曰：索持曰搏，拘持曰撠。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：搏撠，音博戟，谓救鬬者当善㧑解之，毋以手相搏撠，则其怒益炽矣。按撠，谓以手持撠以刺人也。余谓索隐之说善矣，但以撠为持撠以刺人则非也。撠，如汉书「撠太后掖」之撠，师古曰：撠，谓拘持之也。毛晃曰：索持曰搏，拘持曰撠。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":31,"tongjian_id":"8c295d01-db0e-11ef-a68f-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":105,"tongjian_id":"8c295d08-db0e-11ef-baab-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"索隱曰：批，白結翻。亢，苦浪翻。按批者，相排批也，音白滅翻。亢，言敵人相亢拒也。擣者，擊也，衝也。虛，空也。謂前人相亢，必須批之，彼兵若虛則衝擣之，若批其相亢，擊擣彼虛，則是其形相格，其勢自禁止，則彼自爲解也。康曰：亢，極也，高也。擣，築也。乘其高亢而批之，乘其虛而擣之，則其勢自解。批亢擣虛，所謂形格勢禁也。余謂索隱之說爲長。蓋鬬者方相亢拒，則排批之使解；虛者，兩敵距鬬力所不及之處，擣之則雖欲鬬，其勢不能不解，此易見也。格，各額翻，格正也，又擊也，鬬也。吳都賦：「𥜿𥜿笑而被格」，本音如字，協韻音閣。𥜿，與狒同，音父沸翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"索隐曰：批，白结翻。亢，苦浪翻。按批者，相排批也，音白灭翻。亢，言敌人相亢拒也。捣者，击也，冲也。虚，空也。谓前人相亢，必须批之，彼兵若虚则冲捣之，若批其相亢，击捣彼虚，则是其形相格，其势自禁止，则彼自为解也。康曰：亢，极也，高也。捣，筑也。乘其高亢而批之，乘其虚而捣之，则其势自解。批亢捣虚，所谓形格势禁也。余谓索隐之说为长。盖鬬者方相亢拒，则排批之使解；虚者，两敌距鬬力所不及之处，捣之则虽欲鬬，其势不能不解，此易见也。格，各额翻，格正也，又击也，鬬也。吴都赋：「𥜿𥜿笑而被格」，本音如字，协韵音阁。𥜿，与狒同，音父沸翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":47,"tongjian_id":"8c295d07-db0e-11ef-a811-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"康","people_name_jianti_auto":"康","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c295d0d-db0e-11ef-8871-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"康曰：虛，音墟。余謂虛，如字，衝其方虛，卽上所謂「擣虛」也。索隱之說，義亦如此。走，則湊翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"康曰：虚，音墟。余谓虚，如字，冲其方虚，即上所谓「捣虚」也。索隐之说，义亦如此。走，则凑翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":89,"tongjian_id":"8c295d0c-db0e-11ef-8d9e-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"田忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"田忌","start_index":61,"tongjian_id":"8c295d11-db0e-11ef-b1eb-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"濮渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"濮渠","start_index":15,"tongjian_id":"8c295d12-db0e-11ef-b7e2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"酸水","place_name_jianti_auto":"酸水","start_index":18,"tongjian_id":"8c295d13-db0e-11ef-8be2-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"滑臺","place_name_jianti_auto":"滑台","start_index":25,"tongjian_id":"8c295d14-db0e-11ef-8ff5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"瓦亭","place_name_jianti_auto":"瓦亭","start_index":34,"tongjian_id":"8c295d15-db0e-11ef-b0fe-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濮","place_name_jianti_auto":"濮","start_index":43,"tongjian_id":"8c295d16-db0e-11ef-a3da-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"濮渠","place_name_jianti_auto":"濮渠","start_index":45,"tongjian_id":"8c295d17-db0e-11ef-a8d0-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漆城","place_name_jianti_auto":"漆城","start_index":50,"tongjian_id":"8c295d18-db0e-11ef-bd42-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桂城","place_name_jianti_auto":"桂城","start_index":53,"tongjian_id":"8c295d19-db0e-11ef-8491-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桂陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"桂陵","start_index":57,"tongjian_id":"8c295d1a-db0e-11ef-87ee-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"魏","place_name_jianti_auto":"魏","start_index":64,"tongjian_id":"8c295d1b-db0e-11ef-8663-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"桂陵","place_name_jianti_auto":"桂陵","place_note":"河南长垣西北","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"8c295d1c-db0e-11ef-a860-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"曹州","place_name_jianti_auto":"曹州","start_index":77,"tongjian_id":"8c295d1d-db0e-11ef-bb37-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"乘氏縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"乘氏县","start_index":79,"tongjian_id":"8c295d1e-db0e-11ef-a737-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"還，從宣翻，又音如字。水經註：濮渠與酸水會，水東逕滑臺城南，又東南逕瓦亭南，又東南會于濮。濮渠之側有漆城。桂城亦曰桂陵，卽田忌敗魏師處。史記正義曰：桂陵在曹州乘氏縣東南二十一里。濮，博木翻。","note_content_jianti_auto":"还，从宣翻，又音如字。水经注：濮渠与酸水会，水东迳滑台城南，又东南迳瓦亭南，又东南会于濮。濮渠之侧有漆城。桂城亦曰桂陵，即田忌败魏师处。史记正义曰：桂陵在曹州乘氏县东南二十一里。濮，博木翻。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":142,"tongjian_id":"8c295d10-db0e-11ef-8a22-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"link_td_description":"田忌，妫姓，田氏，名忌，字期，又作陈忌、田臣思、田期思，中国战国时期齐国公子。","link_td_id":"Q10002204","link_td_number_id":667220,"people_name":"田忌","people_name_jianti_auto":"田忌","people_xingming":"田忌","start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8c295d21-db0e-11ef-9d75-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_birth_year":-382,"link_death_year":-316,"link_td_description":"孙膑，战国中期军事家，兵家代表人物。","link_td_id":"Q10000349","link_td_number_id":1137,"people_name":"孫子","people_name_jianti_auto":"孙子","people_xingming":"孙膑","start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"8c295d22-db0e-11ef-9c82-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_td_description":"田忌，妫姓，田氏，名忌，字期，又作陈忌、田臣思、田期思，中国战国时期齐国公子。","link_td_id":"Q10002204","link_td_number_id":667220,"peop